Source: soundcraft
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, xz-utils, zstd, desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/storytold/soundcraft

Package: soundcraft
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime set: upstream's own DEB Depends corrected for Debian Testing
# (libasound2 -> libasound2t64; the t64 transition renamed it).
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64, libc6 (>= 2.35), libegl1, libgcc-s1, libvulkan1, libxkbcommon0
Description: Digital audio workstation in pure Rust
 SoundCraft: an open-source, clean-room reimplementation of Avid Pro
 Tools in pure Rust. Record, edit and mix audio and MIDI.
